    80|/**
    81| * Determine the appropriate verdict level based on task record state.
    82| *
    83| * Rules:
    84| * - VERIFIED: only when device QA passes AND feature verification is verified
    85| *   AND no remaining blockers.
    86| * - PARTIAL: code deployed but device QA pending, OR feature verification partial.
